        "content": [
          {
            "type": "title",
            "mainTi": "Central Library"
          },
          {
            "type": "title",
            "title": "It is kept open for 12 hours (8.00 am to 8.00 pm) with Internet browsing facility for all its users."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": [
              "The Central Library of Karpagam College of Engineering (KCE) is a modern, technology-enabled knowledge hub that supports learning, teaching, research, innovation, and lifelong learning. Library has evolved into a vibrant academic resource centre that combines rich scholarly collections, advanced digital technologies, user-centric services, and contemporary learning spaces.",
              "Spread across 55,122 sq. ft., the centrally air-conditioned and Wi-Fi-enabled Library provides a peaceful and stimulating environment for reading, self-learning, collaboration, and research. Its lush green surroundings further enhance the ambience, creating an ideal space for academic engagement."
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
